{"availability":"available","full":"siinghd/brookmd","name":"brookmd","description":"Zero-dep streaming markdown for the browser — Rust→WASM, 100% CommonMark 0.31 + GFM. Built to not melt the main thread on concurrent LLM streams.","category":"Productivity","language":"Rust","stars":9,"forks":2,"created":"2026-05-26T17:35:11Z","updated":"2026-09-15T14:23:07Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://md.hsingh.app","topics":["commonmark","gfm","llm","markdown","react","rust","solid","streaming","svelte","vue","wasm","web-worker"],"demo":"https://md.hsingh.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T02:35:24.500Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T02:35:24.500Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T02:35:24.500Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T01:04:26.560Z","stars":9,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-08T02:35:24.500Z","stars":9,"forks":2}],"technologies":["React","Vue","Svelte","Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Streaming markdown for every platform. One Rust core — incremental parse with speculative closure for mid-stream constructs, stable block identities so unchanged blocks never re-reconcile — compiled to WASM for the web and to native libraries for mobile and desktop. Every boundary emits the same versioned JSON wire, byte-for-byte. 100% CommonMark 0.31 + GFM — 652/652 and 24/24 byte-exact against the reference renderers.","In the browser, wire each LLM stream to a BrookClient and the markdown renders incrementally off the main thread, block by block — so many concurrent streams render without melting the UI thread."],"features":["Off the main thread — a pooled Web Worker per stream; the parser re-parses","only the active tail on each token, patches cross the worker boundary as verified splices (emitted bytes stay O(n) even for one giant growing block — wire delta mode, contract v1.2.0), and heavy renderers (highlighting,…","SSR-safe — imports and renderToString cleanly on the server across React,","Vue, Solid, and Svelte; the worker is created lazily on the client.","Structured block.data channel (opt-in, default off) — tables, headings,"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/siinghd/brookmd/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f1da4ea241d9d66ccbb4db94942469a6cefe6ecf2188e53cdcc9b7874d9808ef","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T01:04:26.671Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T01:04:26.671Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Streaming markdown for every platform. One Rust core — incremental parse with speculative closure for mid-stream constructs, stable block identities so unchanged blocks never re-reconcile — compiled to WASM for the web and to native libraries for mobile and desktop. Every boundary emits the same versioned JSON wire, byte-for-byte. 100% CommonMark 0.31 + GFM — 652/652 and 24/24 byte-exact against the reference renderers.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/siinghd/brookmd/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"f1da4ea241d9d66ccbb4db94942469a6cefe6ecf2188e53cdcc9b7874d9808ef","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/siinghd/brookmd/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T01:04:26.671Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-15T14:23:07Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/siinghd/brookmd/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T01:04:26.671Z","hash":"f1da4ea241d9d66ccbb4db94942469a6cefe6ecf2188e53cdcc9b7874d9808ef","originalBytes":8135,"storedBytes":8135,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["brookmd","bindings","native","packages","crates","experimental","kotlin","react","swift","npm","android","core","every","published","web","ios","over","package","renderer","rust","wire","block","brookmd-core","gfm","one","wasm","brookmd-cabi","brookmd-flutter","brookmd-react-native","flutter","full","platforms","streaming","abi","add","agent","bash","boundary","bun","byte-exact","code","commonmark","dart","default","dom","each","highlighting","install","json","license","live","llms.txt","macos","math","md.hsingh.app